calendar — Chinese lunar calendar and the 24 solar terms (1901–2100)
  Computed with lunar_python by 6tail (https://github.com/6tail/lunar-python), MIT License,
  and cross-checked against the Hong Kong Observatory's Gregorian–Lunar calendar conversion tables
  (https://www.hko.gov.hk). Dates where the two disagree are left blank rather than guessed.
  Public holiday arrangements follow the annual notices of the General Office of the State Council of
  the People's Republic of China.

